In a deployment the files may typically be found under ~/tms/tms-server.
The two main files involved are first-time-setup-sh and first-time-setup.yml.
Burndown involves:
  kubectl delete -f first-time-setup.yml
Burnup involves:
  kubectl create configmap tms-first-time-setup-configmap --from-file first-time-setup-sh
  kubectl create -f first-time-setup.yml
  kubectl wait --timeout=200s --for=condition=complete job/tms-first-time-setup

